[en.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_INVESTIGATE_CLUB]
Thoroughly Investigate the CLUB

[en.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_INVESTIGATE_CLUB_desc]
During the polls, we unexpectedly discovered an organization called “The CLUB”, which is suspected to be a branch of the Changeling spies. They claim to be just a sobriety group, but the members are all marked as “dead” in our archives... The records show that many of them did not have a habit of alcoholism before, and the time they claimed to start drinking coincides with their respective time of alledged death.

[zh.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_INVESTIGATE_CLUB]
全面彻查千界俱乐部

[zh.DECISION_C18_DIE_NEBENWELT_INVESTIGATE_CLUB_desc]
在麒麟普查中，我们意外发现了一个疑似为幻形灵间谍分支的名为“千界俱乐部”的组织，他们声称只是一个戒酒团体，但其中的成员都在我们的档案馆被标记为“死亡”... 档案显示，他们中的很多此前也并不具有酗酒的习惯，他们声称的开始酗酒时间都与他们各自的死亡时间相吻合。
